hook-intent-classifier (examples/demos/hook_classifier/graph.yaml): Classify a VS Code Copilot tool invocation for intent and danger level
daily-horoscope (examples/demos/horoscope/graph.yaml): Generate daily horoscopes for all 12 zodiac signs in parallel
image-that-speaks (examples/demos/image-that-speaks/graph.yaml): Who judges the judge? One LLM generates, two LLMs race to judge, a deterministic gate overrules them both. Rev 13:15 meets model_as_trusted_peer.
innovation-matrix (examples/demos/innovation_matrix/graph.yaml): Generate an Innovation Matrix crossing capabilities with constraints. Task shapes: structured ideation — cross domain capabilities with constraints to surface non-obvious directions.
trivia-quiz (examples/demos/interactive_tool/graph.yaml): A 3-question trivia quiz built with a single interactive_tool node. Demonstrates: start/step/end tool wiring, loop_until condition, interrupt/resume for user input, and automatic session summary.
interview-demo (examples/demos/interview/graph.yaml): Interactive interview with human-in-the-loop
fr-judge (examples/demos/judge/graph.yaml): FR-450 — Standalone FR judge with task-shaped tools and structured verdict output
map-demo (examples/demos/map/graph.yaml): Demonstrates parallel fan-out with type: map. Task shapes: for each item in a list, ask the model — parallel map-reduce over N items.
map-timeout-demo (examples/demos/map-timeout/graph.yaml): Demonstrates per-node timeout for map branches (FR-069)
memory_demo (examples/demos/memory/graph.yaml): Multi-turn code review assistant with memory
meta (examples/demos/meta/graph.yaml): Apply a natural-language verb to a code artifact and return typed output
multi-turn-streaming (examples/demos/multi-turn/graph.yaml): Multi-turn conversation with streaming. First turn waits for user input, subsequent turns stream response then wait for next input.
novel_generator (examples/demos/novel_generator/graph.yaml): AI-powered short story generator with quality-driven iteration
pattern-model-census (examples/demos/pattern_model_census/graph.yaml): Read-only commit-metadata census for architectural/design patterns and LLM model/provider mentions. Structurally mirrors corpus_census with invocation-time discover/extract slots and an LLM-free reducer.
persona-scenario-pipeline (examples/demos/persona_scenarios/graph.yaml): Generate personas and scenarios for a product idea, save as interlinked markdown
philosopher-book (examples/demos/philosopher_book/graph.yaml): The Philosopher writes one chapter at a time. Plan → write a single chapter using Copilot with diary search tools. Run with --var chapter_num=N (1-21). (FR-404)
pipeline-demo (examples/demos/pipeline/graph.yaml): Compile-time pipeline template expansion demo
pipeline-audit (examples/demos/pipeline_audit/graph.yaml): Structural audit of YAMLGraph pipelines — quality gates, silent fallbacks, skip reporting, shared patterns
fr-planner (examples/demos/planner/graph.yaml): FR-452 — Standalone FR planner with task-shaped tools and structured plan output
prompt-caching-demo (examples/demos/prompt-caching/graph.yaml): Demonstrates Anthropic prompt caching with system_segments
prompt-theme-analyzer (examples/demos/prompt_theme_analyzer/graph.yaml): Read prompt files, classify concise themes with map fan-out, aggregate deterministically in Python, then group themes and write a markdown report. (FR-402)
